<title>FINLAND: TABLE- INTERBANK H1 OP PROFIT FIM 6.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE- INTERBANK H1 OP PROFIT FIM 6.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 6.1 vs 1.7</p>
<p> Credit losses					0.6 vs 1.5</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations	15.3 vs 14.4</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.55 vs 0.15</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (BIS), percent	     12.9 vs 17.2</p>
